# Enemy: "Shadow Visitor" (그림자 손님). A tall hooded figure in a long torn robe,
# about twice the protagonist's height, one burning eye slit in the hood, pale
# clawed hands, a moonlight rim (M) so it stays readable in dark scenes.
# 32x56 frames, faces right.
# art v2 (2026-11-22): idle and reach are the ARCANUM XXII pixel works redesign; the
# other states are derived from them.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 32 56
@output ../characters/enemy_shadow_visitor.png
@preview ../previews/enemy_shadow_visitor_x4.png 4
@columns 5

